            "note": "Round 1 income is min(round+1,6)=2. Cinder Scout for 1."
        },
        {
            "seq": 2,
            "seat": 1,
            "actionId": "play_character",
            "params": {
                "card": "i-p1-11"
            },
            "note": "Dust Weaver for 2. Its Bolster trigger finds no other friendly character; the target is optional, so it resolves silently with no choice raised."
        },
        {
            "seq": 3,
            "seat": 0,
            "actionId": "play_attachment",
